<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Application Status Update</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        .email-header {
            background-color: #0077b6;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .email-body p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #555555;
        }
        .doctor-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #222222;
        }
        .reason-box {
            background-color: #fff3f3;
            border-left: 4px solid #e63946;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .reason-box p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #900c3f;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .email-footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #888888;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
        .support-link {
            color: #0077b6;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>Application Status Notification</h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="email-body">
            <p>Dear Dr. <span class="doctor-name"><%= name %></span>,</p>
            
            <p>Thank you for submitting your application to join the <%= platformName || 'Smart Healthcare Limited' %> network. We truly appreciate the time and effort you took to share your professional background with us.</p>
            
            <p>After careful review by our credentialing and medical board committee, we regret to inform you that we are unable to approve your application at this time.</p>

            <% if (locals.rejectionReason) { %>
                <div class="reason-box">
                    <p><strong>Reason / Remarks:</strong> <%= rejectionReason %></p>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <p>This decision does not diminish your professional qualifications; however, it aligns with our current network capacity, specific compliance criteria, or regional requirements.</p>

            <p>If you have any questions or believe this decision was made due to a misunderstanding of your credentials, please feel free to reach out to our support team at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail || 'support@example.com' %>" class="support-link"><%= supportEmail || 'support@example.com' %></a>.</p>

            <p>We sincerely wish you the best in your medical practice and future professional endeavors.</p>

            <p>Warm regards,<br>
            <strong><%= teamName || 'Credentialing Team' %></strong><br>
            <%= platformName || 'Smart Healthcare Limited' %></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= platformName || 'Smart Healthcare Limited' %>. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>